### Insight Hub API
### VS Code: instale a extensão "REST Client" (humao.rest-client)
### JetBrains: suporte nativo em .http files

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
@email = admin@example.com
@password = demo-password-1234

# @name login


# ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# HEALTH
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/health


# ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# AUTH
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────

### Login — salva access_token e refresh_token nas variáveis abaixo
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

###

@accessToken = {{login.response.body.access_token}}
@refreshToken = {{login.response.body.refresh_token}}

### Refresh token
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/refresh?refresh_token={{refreshToken}}


# ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# DOCUMENTS
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────

### Listar documentos
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Listar documentos — com paginação
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/documents?limit=10&offset=0
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Upload de documento (texto)
# Crie um arquivo sample.txt na mesma pasta para usar aqui
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

This is a sample document about quarterly performance.
Aurora division achieved 12% growth in Q3 2025.
The EMEA region led with 18% YoY increase in revenue.
--boundary--

### Upload de documento — tipo não suportado (deve retornar 415)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="image.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

fake-binary-content
--boundary--


# ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# CHAT
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────

### Pergunta sobre documento indexado
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/chat
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "How did Aurora perform in Q3?"
}

### Pergunta sobre dado inexistente (deve responder sem citações)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/chat
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "What is the company's policy on remote work?"
}

### Mensagem vazia — deve retornar 422
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/chat
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": ""
}

### Sem token — deve retornar 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Who are the top clients?"
}
